  "premise_review": [
    "All original C : CrystallineSite, F : Crystal C, nabla : Connection F, H : HeatFlowAction F, e : CrystalEndomorphism F and supplied K remain required exactly; no contract, heat evolution or fixed tensor is independently constructed.",
    "K.existsFixedTensor is an actual dependent existential ∃ _ : FixedTensor nabla e K.object, True supplied by K. tensor_fixed_point_exists genuinely projects it rather than proving a fixed-point existence theorem from analytic or heat hypotheses.",
    "tensor_fixed_point_horizontal genuinely unpacks the supplied witness T and returns T.horizontal. The captured Connection.horizontal is an arbitrary indexed predicate, with no equation linking it to Nabla or a differential in that provider; the conclusion is retained precisely, without a differential interpretation.",
    "tensor_fixed_point_fixed genuinely unpacks the supplied witness T and returns T.fixed, the actual equation e.map K.object T.tensor.underlyingSection = T.tensor.underlyingSection. No equality is dropped or dismissed as only a label.",
    "compatibleEndomorphism retains its complete original HeatCompatibleEndomorphism H e type. Its captured provider contains an actual horizontal-preserving implication but independent commutesWithHeat proposition; this source does not use either to construct the fixed witness.",
    "uniqueness? : Prop is an arbitrary unproved proposition, not Option Prop and not an encoded uniqueness relation. No source theorem asserts it. Preserve the complete field and do not narrow the schema or promote it to uniqueness.",
    "Preserve the explicit original warning that no tensor-valued fixed-point theorem is proved. No new self-provider import, alternative provider, type weakening, analytic fixed-point construction, uniqueness theorem or public mathematical admission is introduced."
  ],
  "split_decision": "Record the mixed package, supplied existential/horizontal consequences and fixed-section equality seam while retaining all four complete commands in exact archives. Removing uniqueness? would narrow the original record; extracting consequences against its original type would add a new legacy self-provider import absent from the original. Neither is done. The genuine proof content is preserved and explicitly acknowledged.",
